// FileStoreUpdateRequest Partial update of a file store. Only the fields present in the body are
// changed, and at least one *updatable* field — `displayName`, `description`,
// `capacityGiB` or `consumers` — must be supplied. An `etag`-only body is not
// an update and is rejected with `400`. Returns the full resource.
