// state, not a patch. To attach an address or an instance group, send the
// current list plus the new entry; to detach one, send the current list
// without it. The platform reconciles the backend to match and reports
// per-consumer progress in the store's read-only `consumerStatus`. Supply the
// store's current `etag` to make the update conditional and avoid clobbering a
// concurrent edit.
