	// above `maximum` (1 PiB) is rejected with `422` and
	// `details[].reason: INVALID_ARGUMENT`.
	//
	// **Not enforced on the backend.** The storage systems behind this API do
	// not currently apply it as a hard quota; a new value is passed to the
	// backend and charged against the `storage_gib` quota, but does not cap
	// what the store can consume.
