// every field carries a real observation, so a zero is data.
// `readyReplicas: 0` on a control plane that is still coming up is exactly
// the signal a caller needs, which is why no field here is omitted when empty.
//
// **`readyReplicas` of `desiredReplicas` is the pair to render**, and the two
// are the only counters here that are not deprecated.
//
// `ready`, `initialized`, `replicas`, `updatedReplicas` and
// `unavailableReplicas` are **deprecated** but still always present, and still
// carry exactly the values they did before `state` existed. Each is documented
// with the field that replaces it, or with a note that nothing here replaces
// it.
